026-08-12T22:10:35.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":4821555,"review":"Excellent apartment! Very good layout of the bedrooms. One bedroom with its own bathroom was in a separate wing , so we could have privacy and be away from each other a bit. Overall, very responsive and proactive host. There were couple of issues with WIFI and a blocked shower, but it was resolved immediately. I will be definitely back and highly recommend this place!","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:20.000000Z"},{"id":4861673,"review":"环境非常好、入住体验非常棒、是我这次旅行最棒的一个点！","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:27.000000Z"},{"id":4895943,"review":"Thank you","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:32.000000Z"},{"id":4932574,"review":"Beautiful home! Host was very responsive, great location and compound. Would definitely stay here again! Super clean and cute, rooms and bathrooms were spacious","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:44.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:44.000000Z"},{"id":4952285,"review":"Excellent stay","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z"},{"id":4959105,"review":"Had an amazing stay in the apartment. It was spacious, modern but felt homey as well, perfect combination. \n\nApartment was walking distance to the marina where you can also get a Tuk Tuk to downtown. \n\nMangroovy estate in general had a “groovy vibe” with the infinity pool which we enjoyed. \n\n5 stars\n\nWill be coming back!","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z"},{"id":4965004,"review":"Just minor comments but overall stay is amazing ","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z"},{"id":4965132,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:46.000000Z"},{"id":5021277,"review":"The place was excellent, comfortable beds \nThe views was excellent from the balcony \nSwimming pool was great so the private beach too.\nAt the end we enjoyed our stay very much.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z"},{"id":5133859,"review":"I always book with Xuru but this time was my worst experience ever as we arrived and didn’t find the apartment ready and the team advised that it’s getting cleaned since 10 am and when i arrived at 1 pm we found that they didn’t even start we were big group arriving from a trip and very tired needed to sleep but we couldn’t sleep before 3 pm cause of the apartment cleaning \r\nThe house keeping had to clean the apartment while we are inside it which was a bad experience \r\nDuring this bad experience the girl from the customer service wasn’t answering my phone calls knowing that we are waiting in the street was so unprofessional \r\nLast but not least my insurance was paid in cash on the previous apartment that i thought it would be transferred automatically \r\nWhile check out they advised that i have no insurance and it took them 30 min to return my insurance that i paid on the first check in\r\nDefinitely next time I’m trying another company","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z"},{"id":5207839,"review":"-","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5222404,"review":"excellent location, very flexible and helpful hosts, the house was a very clean, thank you so much Xuru stays for everything","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5238520,"review":"I loved the place! And the host was very helpful as well.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5243749,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5316310,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:26.000000Z"},{"id":5330158,"review":"Positive:\nEverything was perfect especially location and accommodation\n\nNegative:\nStuff were few and not very helpful","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5346952,"review":"Wonderful location, and very nice view, the house is very clean, and the host is very helpful. Thank you very much Xurx.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:31.000000Z"},{"id":5426155,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5426947,"review":"Place was really comfortable in a great location. Host was very responsive and helpful, would definitely book again!","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5535705,"review":"Positive:\nDoskonała lokalizacja, bardzo duże mieszkanie, odpowiedni układ pomieszczeń, blisko basenu i sklepu. Dobry kontakt z gospodarzem. Bardzo udany pobyt w tym miejscu.\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:58.000000Z"},{"id":5552272,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5590269,"review":"Very clean apt. and responsive","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5626458,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5633596,"review":"It is a wonderful and clean apartment. Everything went smoothly and the staff is friendly. I recommend it for anyone is look for apartment to stay in ElGouna","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5662499,"review":"Very beautiful apartment, exactly as described, responsive and helpful host, the best thing is having access to beach. Highly recommended","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669766,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5720334,"review":"Positive:\nClean well equipped great view\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5740454,"review":"I love it","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5745267,"review":"Everything is great!","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5746122,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5751408,"review":"I recently stayed in this apartment for 5 days and overall it was an excellent experience. The location is perfect — very close to the pools and the beach, which made our stay even more enjoyable. The apartment was comfortable and the host was extremely friendly and helpful. Check-in was smooth, clear, and very easy.\n\nThere are a few small things that could be improved: there were no coffee cups available (I had to buy some and leave them for future guests), no trash bags were provided, and there was no detergent for the washing machine.\n\nOther than these minor details, the apartment was great and we really enjoyed our stay. I would definitely come back again in the future.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5777050,"review":"This amazing unit in M7 is directly overlooking both the pool and the beach, giving us the perfect view to enjoy our morning coffee and our evening talks. The place is very spacious, beautifully furnished, and fully equipped with everything you need for a comfortable stay. We truly enjoyed our time here and would definitely recommend it!","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5785295,"review":"Great apartment and a great location overlooking the pool and sea. \n\nThe unit was very clean as usual. \n\nFew minutes walk to the beach. \n\nVery responsive and kind host.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5794638,"review":"Good Host, clean room, great location.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5801458,"review":"Positive:\nL appartement est parfait ainsi que la résidence je recommande vous pouvez y aller les yeux fermés\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5837593,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5840593,"review":"Great location and view, within walking distance from the beach and spacious rooms . The direct pool was not well maintained, but there is another well-maintained pool within walking distance. I had some concerns regarding the cleanliness of the bathrooms and the couch. Also, make sure to bring your own kettle, as the one provided was not clean ,this is actually the second time I’ve faced the same issue.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5846550,"review":"The apartment looked even better in real life. The host is super responsive and helpful. The area is great. A walking distance from the beach and restaurants. I’ll definitely stay at the same place again in the future.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5875097,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5881107,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5907843,"review":"Positive:\nاقامه جميله مريحه في كل حاجه\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5939282,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5963047,"review":"Exceptional service as usual","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6118683,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6129969,"review":"À good place to stay in Mangroovy . Close to the beach and nearby restaurants. I would recommend the place","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6141848,"review":"Thank you for the great hospitality! The check-in and check-out processes were very smooth, and the unit was clean and exactly as described. Thanks again—I will definitely consider Xuru Stays for my upcoming visits to El Gouna.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6159840,"review":"Host is very responsive, nice location, clean apartment.","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6175836,"review":"I really enjoyed the place it was very clean and neat the view and location were amazing and I would like to come again but my only problem that before I came we were informed that there was internet connection but when we arrived we tried many times connecting and it didn’t work and we contacted them but every time the response was vague and the problem wasn’t solved all of our stay but overall it was a really fun experience","rental_id":182842,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[{"id":97,"key":"heating","en_title":"Heating","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":182842,"amenity_id":97}},{"id":75,"key":"fridge","en_title":"Fridge","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":182842,"amenity_id":75}},{"id":79,"key":"full_equipped_kitchen","en_title":"Full Equipped Kitchen","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:19.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":182842,"amenity_id":79}},{"id":192,"key":"hot_water","en_title":"Hot water","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:54.000000Z","updated_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:54.000000Z","pivot":{"rental_id":182842,"amenity_id":192}},{"id":39,"key":"coffee_maker","en_title":"Coffee Maker","created_at":"2023-04-27T15:25:18.000000Z","updated_at":"